From d115f656a9b7ea63c17800ec6a61b9c1a9605dee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cnsj-123 <175115749+cnsj-123@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 07:20:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(context): add limited real injection selector

Phase 4A-3D introduces an independent, testable Real Injection Selector. The Gateway never builds content from a mutation directly: it sends selected_body, which is the exact cache-stabilized forward_body unless the default-OFF master flag OMBRE_GATEWAY_CONTEXT_REAL_INJECTION=1 is set AND the existing Preview, Gate and Request Mutation Shadow results all re-verify (revision, render SHA, mutated SHA, invariants, token budget, DATA-ONLY envelope). Every deny, mismatch or exception is fail-open. Telemetry is privacy-safe and never contains rendered context text.
